zj/thumb/b/b4/8zh740hedi87gh5lrpqrfsej3p98pqc.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%B9%BB%E5%BD%B1%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b4/8zh740hedi87gh5lrpqrfsej3p98pqc.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%B9%BB%E5%BD%B1%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b4/8zh740hedi87gh5lrpqrfsej3p98pqc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />幻影风暴\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>4X3内\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对目标方向<font color=\"red\">3×4</font>范围内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">75%</font>伤害，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼攻击1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼攻击1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4十字 4X3内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/